#: ../../source/houses.md:107
msgid "High-Latitude Handling"
msgstr "Gestion des hautes latitudes"

#: ../../source/houses.md:109
msgid ""
"Projection-based systems (Placidus, Koch) break down at extreme latitudes"
" (roughly above 66° N or below 66° S) because the ecliptic can fail to "
"intersect the prime vertical."
msgstr ""
"Les systèmes basés sur la projection (Placidus, Koch) deviennent invalides "
"aux latitudes extrêmes (approximativement au-delà de 66° N ou en deçà de "
"66° S) car l'écliptique peut ne pas intersecter le premier vertical."

#: ../../source/houses.md:111
msgid ""
"**`polar_fallback=\"raise\"` (default)** — raises `HighLatitudeError` "
"when the calculation is geometrically impossible."
msgstr ""
"**`polar_fallback=\"raise\"` (défaut)** — lève `HighLatitudeError` "
"lorsque le calcul est géométriquement impossible."

#: ../../source/houses.md:113
msgid ""
"**Alternative fallback** — pass the name of another system to use as a "
"fallback:"
msgstr ""
"**Fallback alternatif** — passer le nom d'un autre système à utiliser "
"comme fallback :"

#: ../../source/houses.md:126
msgid ""
"Whole Sign and Equal never raise `HighLatitudeError` — they work "
"everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Les Signes entiers et les Maisons égales ne lèvent jamais `HighLatitudeError` "
"— ils fonctionnent partout."

